#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:50
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you're using this setting to work around an application that demands "
"attention too often, first look for a setting in the app to disable that "
"behavior. If you don't find one, consider reporting this as a bug to the "
"app's developer."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bruger denne indstilling til at omgå en applikation, der kræver "
"opmærksomhed for ofte, skal du først kigge efter en indstilling i appen for "
"at deaktivere denne adfærd. Hvis du ikke finder en, kan du overveje at "
"rapportere dette som en fejl til appens udvikler."

#: qml/ConfigBehavior.qml:98
msgctxt "@info displayed as InlineMessage"
msgid ""
"The compositor does not support displaying windows side by side, so a "
"textual list will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"Compositoren understøtter ikke at vise vinduerne side om side, så i stedet "
"vises en liste i tekstform."

